CommitDate: Thu Oct 8 09:36:59 2026 -0300

    Preserve PSG state across savestates
    
    Extend PSG savestates to preserve the internal generator state needed
    for deterministic audio restoration, including tone counters and
    phases, noise counter and LFSR, channel samples, and divider state.
    
    Also preserve Game Gear stereo routing, FM detect state, System E PSG2
    state, and the AudioMix phase. Store the extended PSG data in versioned
    extension words while retaining compatibility with legacy savestates.
    
    Write the extension presence marker last so an interrupted save cannot
    make an incomplete extension appear valid.

